<title>FRANCE: Elf confirms ponders share buy-back.</title>
<headline>Elf confirms ponders share buy-back.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Elf Aquitaine confirmed on Thursday that it would ask its shareholders for an authorisation to buy back shares but a spokesman added this did not automatically mean the oil group was going to do so.</p>
<p>&quot;We will ask authorisation so that the company has the option to do so,&quot; a spokesman said.</p>
<p>He could not comment on a report in the La Tribune newspaper which said Elf would ask authorisation to buy back shares up to a limit of 15 percent of the share capital.</p>
</text>
